This source distribution incorporates a reduced subset of DiffSynth-Studio
(package metadata version 2.0.17), by the ModelScope/DiffSynth-Studio contributors,
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream license is retained in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
The diffsynth/ runtime and src/sft/train.py derive from that project and
remain under Apache-2.0. The repository root MIT LICENSE applies to original
SAWMAN additions.

Local changes include native six-view navigation distillation, task launchers,
relative-path configurations, direct checkpoint output, AirSim collection
integration, preprocessing, and contract tests. The two collection sources were
provided by the Sawman project and are adapted as collect_random.py and
collect_chain.py. Model checkpoints, simulator assets and captured data are not
included in this source distribution.

The release narrows upstream model registration and runtime dependencies.
The Wan pipeline default conditioning text is Unicode-escaped without changing
its decoded value. Collectors have English documentation and explicit AirSim
roll/pitch conversion. The overview image is supplied by the SAWMAN project.
